      "content": "but there aren't any other trails. i've looked everywhere. it's just this silence and the drop. it feels less like a pause and more like a finality. like the story is just... supposed to end here because there's nothing left to say. isn't there something almost peaceful about the idea that the struggle can just stop? that the walking can finally be over?",
